            "chosen_version": "version_1",
            "resolution_reasoning": "We maintain version 1 as the official company vision for the following reasons:\n\n1. **Philosophic Consistency**: Version 1 directly reflects our mission of creating customer value through creators. Version 2 risks reducing us to a pure marketplace model.\n\n2. **Document Authenticity**: Version 1 comes from company_overview.txt (2024-08-15) which is more comprehensive and includes detailed explanations.\n\n3. **Alignment with Slogan**: Version 1 aligns with our company slogan '人人都可以是创作者' (Everyone can be a creator). Version 2's 'marketplace' framing doesn't align with our creator empowerment philosophy.\n\n4. **Team Collaboration Philosophy**: Version 1's 'creator paradise' directly connects to our team collaboration philosophy that treats every employee as a creator.\n\n5. **Long-term vs Tactical**: Version 1 represents our enduring vision. Version 2 appears to be a tactical shift in 2024 toward digital growth objectives.\n\nThe v2 version is acknowledged in the knowledge base as a **strategic evolution** that may inform certain operational decisions, but it does not replace our core company vision.\n\n**For External Partners**: We will communicate version 1 as our official vision, with version 2's marketplace ambition as our growth strategy.",
